# Nothing in the running app reads this file. It is only a map.
#
# Local Worker (secrets and server config), gitignored:
#   apps/worker/.dev.vars
#   Copy from apps/worker/.dev.vars.example, or run `pnpm setup` once.
#
# Local browser (public UI config), gitignored:
#   apps/web/.env.local
#   Copy from apps/web/.env.example.
#
# Deployed Worker:
#   Non-secrets are vars in apps/worker/wrangler.jsonc
#   (ENVIRONMENT, AUTH_MODE, and later APP_BASE_URL).
#   Secrets are Worker secrets, never a file in git:
#   ENCRYPTION_KEY, CLERK_SECRET_KEY, GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY,
#   GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, RESEND_API_KEY.
#   The Vite build needs VITE_AUTH_MODE and VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
#   in the environment when `pnpm --filter @exokortex/web build` runs.
